#ASSERT `s 879(3) where the land subject to the charge is situated is material` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 879(4) the deposit is to be treated as a charge on those book debts for the purposes of section 878(7)(b)(vii)` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 879(4) the deposit is to be treated as a charge on those book debts for the purposes of section 878(7)(b)(vii)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5) the date of creation: a floating charge, the date the instrument was executed by the company; any other charge, the date the right was constituted as a real right
#ASSERT `s 879(5) the date of the creation of the charge` TRUE (Date 1 2 2025) (Date 9 2 2025) EQUALS Date 1 2 2025
#ASSERT `s 879(5) the date of the creation of the charge` FALSE (Date 1 2 2025) (Date 9 2 2025) EQUALS Date 9 2 2025

