§§ `s 881 Charge by way of ex facie absolute disposition, etc`
-- (1) compliance with 878(1) does not of itself render the charge unavailable as security for later debts
#ASSERT `s 881(1) compliance with section 878(1) of itself renders the charge unavailable as security for indebtedness incurred after the date of compliance` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 881(1) compliance with section 878(1) of itself renders the charge unavailable as security for indebtedness incurred after the date of compliance` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 881(1) compliance with section 878(1) of itself renders the charge unavailable as security for indebtedness incurred after the date of compliance` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) an increase by a further back letter or agreement: a further charge is held to have been created
#ASSERT `s 881(2) a further charge is held to have been created` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 881(2) a further charge is held to have been created` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 881(2) a further charge is held to have been created` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3) the Chapter applies to the further charge, and its date of creation is the date the further back letter or agreement was executed
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(a) references in Chapter 2 to a charge are references to the further charge` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(a) references in Chapter 2 to a charge are references to the further charge` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(a) references in Chapter 2 to a charge are references to the further charge` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(b) the date of the creation of the further charge` (JUST TRUE) (Date 12 5 2025) EQUALS JUST (Date 12 5 2025)
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(b) the date of the creation of the further charge` (JUST FALSE) (Date 12 5 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 881(3)(b) the date of the creation of the further charge` NOTHING (Date 12 5 2025) EQUALS NOTHING

